    "searchCoverage": "Official LIFX HTTP API is HTTPS JSON at https://api.lifx.com/v1. Access tokens are generated in LIFX Cloud settings and sent as Authorization Bearer. Docs mention OAuth 2 access token language; the documented live path is a generated personal token, not an OAuth authorization-code flow. GET /lights/all is the documented list used by the pinned credential validator. Set-state, toggle, activate-scene, and effects writes are omitted. Operator is Feit Electric in California, United States. Dated incident search on 2026-09-13 found no current unresolved LIFX platform compromise. Bounded coverage is not a breach-free claim.",
